#: plugins/kiviozoomtool/tool_zoom.cpp:66
msgid "You can zoom the document that it fits into the window width."
msgstr "អ្នក​អាច​ពង្រីក​ឯកសារ​ឲ្យ​បង្ហាញ​ពេញ​ទទឹង​បង្អួច ។"

